  "question": {
    "text": "Figure shows the variation of the internal energy&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math> with the density <math><mi>ρ</mi></math> of an ideal monoatomic gas for a thermodynamic process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math>. Process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math> is a part of a rectangular hyperbola. Find the work done (in joule) by gas in process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0049_e8853a5a7eab.jpg\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0049_63173d3f5eaa.png\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br />Suppose final internal energy is <math><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Process AB is isobaric process<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mrow></msub></math> = constant<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br />In process AB<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />n = number of mole<br /><br />f = degree of freedom<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math> = Change in temperature<br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math><br /><br />Work done <math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
  }
